  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU own contribution to Fair Trade Center through  Forum Syd - EU own contribution to Fair Trade Center through</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EU-egeninsats Fair Trade Center via Forum Syd</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med projektet &#xe4;r att uppn&#xe5; vettiga l&#xf6;ner och arbetsf&#xf6;rh&#xe5;llanden inom den globala textilindustrin. Fair Trade       Center samarbetar med Clean Clothes Campaign och organisationer i 14  andra EU-l&#xe4;nder kring detta.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal of the project is to achieve decent wages and decent working conditions in the global gannent industry.                     Fair Trade Center has together with the Dutch organization Clean     Clothes Campaign (CCC) and organizations in 14 other member states    been granted funding from the European Commission for this             project.</narrative>
  </description>
